 end="00:42.390">a </span><span begin="00:42.390" end="00:42.611">fly</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.927" end="00:45.085"><span begin="00:42.927" end="00:43.100">Then </span><span begin="00:43.100" end="00:43.272">she </span><span begin="00:43.272" end="00:43.428">aimed </span><span begin="00:43.428" end="00:43.615">at </span><span begin="00:43.615" end="00:43.817">my </span><span begin="00:43.817" end="00:43.989">chest </span><span begin="00:43.989" end="00:44.177">with </span><span begin="00:44.177" end="00:44.381">love </span><span begin="00:44.381" end="00:44.649">in </span><span begin="00:44.649" end="00:44.852">her </span><span begin="00:44.852" end="00:45.116">eye</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.116" end="00:47.742"><span begin="00:45.116" end="00:45.304">I </span><span begin="00:45.304" end="00:45.491">said </span><span begin="00:45.491" end="00:45.694">she </span><span begin="00:45.694" end="00:45.877">aimed </span><span begin="00:45.877" end="00:46.049">at </span><span begin="00:46.049" end="00:46.398">my </span><span begin="00:46.398" end="00:46.632">chest </span><span begin="00:46.632" end="00:46.851">with </span><span begin="00:46.851" end="00:47.086">love </span><span begin="00:47.086" end="00:47.211">in </span><span begin="00:47.211" end="00:47.397">her </span><span begin="00:47.397" end="00:47.594">eye</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.594" end="00:49.812"><span begin="00:47.594" end="00:47.766">She </span><span begin="00:47.766" end="00:47.937">was </span><span begin="00:47.937" end="00:48.125">walking </span><span begin="00:48.125" end="00:48.867">around </span><span begin="00:48.867" end="00:49.055">with </span><span begin="00:49.055" end="00:49.236">a </span><span begin="00:49.236" end="00:49.435">loaded </span><span begin="00:49.435" end="00:49.812">shotgun</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.271" end="00:52.853"><span begin="00:50.271" end="00:50.575">Ready </span><span begin="00:50.575" end="00:50.778">to </span>